                    <div class="faq_desc">
                        <h5>How does IPstress work?</h5>
                        <p> Pick a plan that fits the capacity you need, pay by card through Stripe, and launch tests from the Hub while your plan is active. Our backends handle the routing and concurrency so you can focus on the target. </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq_desc">
                        <h5>What payment methods do you accept?</h5>
                        <p> Card payments are handled securely by Stripe. Your card details never touch our servers. </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq_desc">
                        <h5>How long does support take?</h5>
                        <p> Tickets are answered around the clock. Most replies land within a few hours. </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq_desc">
                        <h5>Can I cancel or get a refund?</h5>
                        <p> Plans are non-recurring &mdash; they expire at the end of the term. If a plan is unusable due to a fault on our side, we issue a prorated refund through support. </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq_desc">
                        <h5>Is my account safe?</h5>
                        <p> Passwords are hashed, and card payments are handled by Stripe. We keep only the account and plan data needed to run the panel. </p>
                    </div>
